    <author>zhengqijun0121@qq.com (zhengqijun0121)</author>
    <guid>https://zhengqijun0121.github.io/blog/002_ubuntu%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%96%B0%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="创建新用户账户">创建新用户账户</h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo useradd -s /bin/bash -m -G sudo test</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<ul>
<li><code>-s /bin/bash</code>: 将 <code>/bin/bash</code> 设置为新账户的登录 shell</li>
<li><code>-m</code>: 创建用户的主目录</li>
<li><code>-G sudo</code>: 确保用户可以使用 <code>sudo</code></li>
</ul>
<h2 id="设置新用户账户密码">设置新用户账户密码</h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo passwd test</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h2 id="删除用户账户">删除用户账户</h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">userdel -r test</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<ul>
<li><code>-r</code>: 删除用户主目录</li>
</ul>]]></description>
